# snapshot on every start, so nothing can be cached there), pinned by the SHA-256 of the bytes actually downloaded.
#
# One file per line: <file name> <sha256> <url> [<fallback url>…]. The guest checks every hash with Get-FileHash and
# refuses to use a file which does not match. Bump a pin only with a hash computed from what was downloaded, never typed
